---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Linear Algebra Cheat Sheet | Free Matrices & Vectors"
  description="Complete linear algebra cheat sheet with matrices, vectors, and operations. Free download for math and engineering students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Linear Algebra<br><span>Cheat Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>Matrices, vectors, and operations. From basics to advanced topics.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Vectors</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Operations</h3>
        <pre><code>u + v = (u₁+v₁, u₂+v₂, u₃+v₃)
c · v = (cv₁, cv₂, cv₃)
|v| = √(v₁² + v₂² + v₃²)</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Dot Product</h3>
        <pre><code>u · v = u₁v₁ + u₂v₂ + u₃v₃
u · v = |u||v|cos(θ)</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Cross Product</h3>
        <pre><code>u × v = (u₂v₃ - u₃v₂, 
         u₃v₁ - u₁v₃, 
         u₁v₂ - u₂v₁)</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Matrices</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Basic Operations</h3>
        <pre><code>(A + B)ᵢⱼ = Aᵢⱼ + Bᵢⱼ
(cA)ᵢⱼ = cAᵢⱼ
(AB)ᵢⱼ = Σₖ AᵢₖBₖⱼ</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Determinant (2×2)</h3>
        <pre><code>det(A) = ad - bc
A = [[a, b], [c, d]]</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Inverse (2×2)</h3>
        <pre><code>A⁻¹ = (1/det(A)) × 
      [[d, -b], [-c, a]]</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Eigenvalues & Eigenvectors</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Definition</h3>
        <pre><code>Av = λv
where λ is eigenvalue
and v is eigenvector</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Characteristic Equation</h3>
        <pre><code>det(A - λI) = 0</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
